{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04935","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 岑羲","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银牓重楼出雾开，金舆步辇向天来。\n泉声迥入吹箫曲，山势遥临献寿杯。\n帝女含笑流飞电，乾文动色象昭回。\n诚愿北极拱尧日，微臣拚舞咏康哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}